  "title": "Bluesky Expands AI-Driven Social Tools for Creation and Sharing",
  "summary": "Bluesky introduces a new AI-powered tool that allows users to create interactive social experiences like games, quizzes, and dashboards, enabling them to share these creations directly on social media platforms. This shift marks a move toward user-generated content generation powered by AI.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Bluesky's Attie AI tool now enables users to create interactive experiences like games, quizzes, and dashboards that can be shared on social platforms.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The tool has been described as a way to use AI to build personal feeds, now expanding to include smaller, more social-based apps.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Bluesky CEO Toni Schneider stated the tool's development aims to empower users to share their creativity more easily.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
